## Error Handling

All functions handle errors gracefully:

```python
from src import scanner, database

# Returns None if file doesn't exist
metadata = scanner.extract_metadata(Path("/nonexistent/file.txt"))
if metadata is None:
    print("File not found or unreadable")

# Returns -1 if database error
file_id = database.add_file(...)
