## Glossary

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| **Database** | File (`tigermemory.db`) storing all your indexed metadata |
| **Metadata** | Information about files (name, size, type, date) |
| **Index** | The organized collection of all files in the database |
| **Schema** | The structure/design of the database tables |
| **Query** | A question asked to the database (e.g., "find all PDFs") |
| **Export** | Save search results to JSON or CSV file |
| **CLI** | Command-line interface (terminal/command prompt) |
| **SQLite** | Lightweight local database (no server needed) |
| **JSON** | Human-readable data format (easy to read/edit) |
| **CSV** | Spreadsheet format (opens in Excel/Sheets) |

